{"server":"cn","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_st03","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_st03","title":"艺术馆餐厅","storyCode":"CR-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"99c1272394332a40657946b06a75f8869a63cf2be622c790ce006cead258b118","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomB"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得现在是午休时间，如果需要提审，你可能要晚点来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是来提审你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，怎么，罗德岛也想踩着我的尸体分一杯羹吗？欢迎欢迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是来替坎黛拉女士告知你多索雷斯对你的最终处理结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依据多索雷斯市长办公室的判断，多索雷斯将不会审判你的罪行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我猜猜，把我交给联合政府？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然马特奥是个蠢货，但他毕竟是联合政府在多索雷斯的代表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我三番五次地耍他玩，联合政府肯定等不及要把我挫骨扬灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对局势的判断很精准。联合政府确实想把你抓去拉乌尼达公审，就像他们对马特奥做的一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一场公审？很好，我很期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，雷内尔先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将被送回卡西米尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你再说一遍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商业联合会向坎黛拉施加了压力，希望将你送回卡西米尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再说一遍？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你父亲在联合会中留下的人脉发挥了作用，你现在不必留在多索雷斯，也不用去拉乌尼达，你可以回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我不会回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会回到那些最卑劣、最下贱、最可悲的东西中去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今也由不得你了，雷内尔先生，不管你的最终归属是哪里，都是你鲁莽行动造成的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是苦是甜，你都得自己咽下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，老东西......你还真是阴魂不散啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还有一件事，你需要决定你财产的归属问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得好像，我真的能自己决定一样，坎黛拉不是早就想方设法把它们挪去其他地方了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一些固定资产......没有人敢接手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就在这份转让合同上随便写个名字吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就是下一个路过这里的人好了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亚兹先生，你来监区干什么？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指认假装人质的马特奥手下啊。反倒是你，你喊我干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......你......反正还没落笔，你随时可以反悔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反悔？我从来都不反悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......何况，这么一想也不赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把它留给真正热爱艺术的家伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷内尔最后真的把那位老消防员的名字写上去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。送他出多索雷斯的时候，我最后向他确认了一次，他还是在监区的那套说辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他真是连他父亲一丁点的特质都没有继承。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，他大概不讨厌这种评价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，但这句话可不是在夸他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长保镖","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士，您和埃内斯托先生的咖啡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好浓的香气！布克先生，我能请教一下用的是哪种咖啡豆吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市长保镖","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是坎黛拉女士最近常喝的三种深烘豆拼配。请二位慢用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在事情告一段落，要见见你在多索雷斯其他的熟人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我在进城之前没想过要惊动任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的确，假如一切都风平浪静的话，你本可以不惊动任何人，但多索雷斯永远不可能风平浪静，你从来都知道这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像现在，雷内尔的这场闹剧过后，联合政府在多索雷斯的声势遭到了沉重打击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管从拉乌尼达寄来的抗议信一封接一封，但雷内尔和他的财产，他们想都别想。多索雷斯不是他们俯首帖耳的附庸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可与之相应，其余两方也已经迫不及待——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞧我，光顾着说这些没意思的东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会，这些都是很有意义的信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来，埃内斯托，尝尝看这种拼配合不合你的口味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很浓郁......但也很奇妙的口感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说来听听？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能分辨出三种豆的品种和香气，但我说不清究竟哪种豆才是其中占比最大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三种香气原本各自为战，此消彼长，可很快又会在口中融汇成浓烈的焦香，再也不分彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"精准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种拼配最大的卖点在于它没有严苛的比例限制，只要三种豆的占比不出现太大差距，就总能保持这种稳定的焦香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，合你的口味吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没法下结论？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，那家店就在那里，只要你回来，随时都喝得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅如此，只要你想，让那家咖啡店按你的想法调配豆子，甚至往咖啡里加气泡水，也绝非不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，您说笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说笑吗？我倒不这么认为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我的确很期待你的选择，埃内斯托。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，埃内斯托，你和这位坎黛拉市长聊了好长时间啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，我和她也算是老相识，还有挺多东西要聊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聊了这么久，她是不是还挺喜欢你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这人......和自己相关的东西，是真的一句话也不愿多说啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，既然你不愿意说，那我就不打听了，哼哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你去问拉菲艾拉，她也不会告诉你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是会什么读心的源石技艺吗？你怎么知道我要去问拉菲艾拉的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都写在你脸上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧啧，这人好可怕啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便，我倒是从早上出发前就知道肯定会迟到，也很感谢你一直在这里等我，但我们现在已经错过和迪亚兹约好的时间了哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——糟了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商业联合会员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，雷内尔·科瓦尔斯基先生，您先请上车，我去拿行李。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷内尔面无表情地坐进后座，等车门合上后，他觉得温度有些高，于是将外套脱下放在一旁，随后倚在靠背上，正准备松开自己的衣领。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但车外一声异响打断了他的动作，他转头看向窗外，看见商业联合会的员工晕倒在车旁，不省人事。\n随后，轻敲玻璃的声响从车的另一侧响起，他顺着声音回头，看见有个熟悉的人站在车外。\n雷内尔摇下车窗，与一双黑亮的眼睛对上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以麻烦您载我一程吗，先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要去哪里呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不一向是由你来决定的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前你总跟着我四处奔波，或许这次该由你来决定我们的目的地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的没有想去的地方吗，米沃什？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去哪里都一样，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是有些不一样的，这次我真的身无分文了，除了后备箱那两个行李箱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，我来开车好了，等到燃料耗尽，车停在哪里，我们就去哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好，你说了算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"冲雷内尔露出一个笑容，米沃什打开前门，坐上了驾驶位，在启动前，他从后视镜看到了雷内尔的脸。\n此刻，雷内尔的表情混合着迷惑、欣喜和些许的犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来有些话想问我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么回来？为什么不离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道不知道答案吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我不是询问，我只是想证实那个答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别这么笃定，或许我很快就会因为忍受不了你而选择离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷内尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，不是今天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从后视镜收回视线，米沃什重重发动引擎，银色轿车绝尘而去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"如今，克里斯达尔艺术馆的展厅仍然保持着那一天的样貌。\n破碎的展柜，被烧焦的地面，出现裂痕的墙体；五彩斑斓的射灯，肆意妄为的涂鸦，狂放不羁的音乐......\n除了房间正中央的大圆桌。\n火候正好的烤肉正在桌子上滋滋作响，散发出诱人的香气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手呀，怎么都没反应？难道不饿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......只是没想到这里会变成烤肉店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，这栋楼被当成了战场，又被炸弹炸了一通，那些艺术品没法放在这，楼空着又可惜，不如拿来搞点副业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好多索雷斯电视台缺了雷内尔这个热点，开始把鼻子伸到我们社区来，造谣说我们的艺术家们没人会做饭，整天吃仙人掌干过日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒要让他们看看什么才是真正的玻利瓦尔美食！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那，这个串烤洋葱蘑菇驮兽肉来一份——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......迪亚兹先生的手艺真是没的说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，我们四个也在泰拉游历了许多地方，玻利瓦尔的烤肉可还是头一次品尝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们之前都去了哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们一开始落在了萨尔贡的荒漠里，在罗德岛短暂停留，取得了“彩虹小队”身份之后，我们各自又去了一些地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔贡的雨林，萨米的冰原，哥伦比亚的矿场和城市，乌萨斯针叶林间的村庄......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尽管如此，我们踏足过的地方也只是这片大地很小的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唯一的遗憾是列维·克里奇科和他疯狂的实验室一起埋在了萨尔贡的地下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人犯了思乡病，恐怕只能找一条和来时不一样的路回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你们找到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（耸肩）还差得远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想你们一定不介意多几个旅伴帮你们一起找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，越多越好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，Lord，那个是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我来替Lord隆重介绍一下这款“乌萨斯特饮”——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"窗外忽然传来吵闹声。\n吃饱喝足的彩虹小队成员们扭头看去，习惯性地以为克里斯达尔艺术馆外又出了什么麻烦——\n然后，第一个明白了是什么情况的人无奈地耸了耸肩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g4_galleriessquare_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经跟老爹说好了，今天轮到我们跳沃尔珀小步舞的用这块广场，你们的古典音乐该关掉了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可特克诺说她最近就喜欢听我们三拍子的华尔兹！不信你问她，她就在墙边上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"就是就是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺，你过来，你说这事到底怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，别用这种事烦我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时间为了放什么音乐吵架，不如来看看我的作品！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的作品？可你的手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，过来就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哦！这......这真是你画的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我苦练了这么长时间，终于抓到用左手用劲的门道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺，别练了，快进来！你肯定没喝过这种叫乌萨斯特饮的东西，再晚可就没有了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
